sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as Agente MCP
    participant Molu as molu (Front MCP)
    participant Hub as Hub Registry
    participant RPI as RPI Provider
    participant Xolu as xolu Sustrato

    Note over Agent,Xolu: Flujo normal de herramienta admitida
    Agent->>Molu: tools/call {name: "walk", args: {...}}
    Molu->>Hub: ResolveTool("walk")
    Hub->>RPI: Admit(ctx, query, candidates)
    RPI-->>Hub: admitted[] (incluye "walk")
    Hub-->>Molu: ToolDescriptor admitido
    
    alt Tool es primitivo genérico (walk/find/get)
        Molu->>Xolu: Walk/Find/Get via XoluClient
        alt Xolu responde OK
            Xolu-->>Molu: Resultado exitoso
            Molu-->>Agent: Respuesta exitosa (MCP result)
        else Xolu rechaza transición FSM
            Xolu-->>Molu: error {code: "XOLU-INVALID_TRANSITION", message: "guarda: estado inválido"}
            Molu->>Molu: WrapXoluInvalidTransition() preserva verbatim
            Molu-->>Agent: error {code: "XOLU-INVALID_TRANSITION", message: "guarda: estado inválido"}
        else Xolu inalcanzable (timeout/5xx)
            Molu->>Molu: NewSubstrateUnavailable() con RetryMetadata
            Molu-->>Agent: error {code: "XOLU-MOLU-FRONT-SUBSTRATE_UNAVAILABLE", details: {lastSuccessfulContact, nextRetryAt, attemptNumber, maxAttempts}}
        end
    else Tool es función de dominio (namespace.Nombre)
        Molu->>Xolu: Walk (ejecuta FSM de dominio)
        ... mismo flujo de errores ...
    end

    Note over Agent,Xolu: Flujo: herramienta NO admitida (RPI Admit retorna vacío)
    Agent->>Molu: tools/call {name: "work_orders.CreateOrder", args: {...}}
    Molu->>Hub: ResolveTool("work_orders.CreateOrder")
    Hub->>RPI: Admit(ctx, query, candidates)
    RPI-->>Hub: admitted[] = [] (vacío por tenant/rol)
    Hub-->>Molu: NOT_OFFERED
    Molu-->>Agent: error {code: "XOLU-MOLU-FRONT-NOT_OFFERED", message: "tool not offered for tenant"}

    Note over Agent,Xolu: Flujo: objeto NO encontrado (molu detecta)
    Agent->>Molu: tools/call {name: "get", args: {id: "obj-404"}}
    Molu->>Xolu: Get(ctx, {id: "obj-404", tenant: "t-1"})
    Xolu-->>Molu: NOT_FOUND (o molu detecta)
    Molu->>Molu: NewNotFound() o WrapXoluNotFound()
    Molu-->>Agent: error {code: "XOLU-MOLU-FRONT-NOT_FOUND" / "XOLU-NOT_FOUND"}

    Note over Agent,Xolu: Flujo: consulta válida SIN resultados
    Agent->>Molu: tools/call {name: "find", args: {query: {status: "archived"}}}
    Molu->>Xolu: Find(ctx, {tenant: "t-1", query: {status: "archived"}})
    Xolu-->>Molu: FindResponse {Results: [], Total: 0}
    Molu->>Molu: NewEmpty()
    Molu-->>Agent: error {code: "XOLU-MOLU-FRONT-EMPTY", message: "query returned no results"}

    Note over Agent,Xolu: Flujo: violación de contrato (schema inválido)
    Agent->>Molu: tools/call {name: "work_orders.CreateOrder", args: {description: "x"}}
    Molu->>Molu: Validar input contra schema del publicador
    Molu->>Molu: NewContractViolation() con fields: ["title", "due_date"]
    Molu-->>Agent: error {code: "XOLU-MOLU-FRONT-CONTRACT_VIOLATION", details: {fields: ["title", "due_date"]}}

    Note over Agent,Xolu: Flujo: código XOLU-* genérico preservado verbatim
    Agent->>Molu: tools/call {name: "walk", args: {...}}
    Molu->>Xolu: Walk(...)
    Xolu-->>Molu: error {code: "XOLU-RATE_LIMITED", message: "rate limit", details: {retry_after: 60}}
    Molu->>Molu: WrapXoluError() preserva verbatim
    Molu-->>Agent: error {code: "XOLU-RATE_LIMITED", message: "rate limit", details: {retry_after: 60}}